      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA SCANDAL (8) goes very well this trip starting five times for three wins and two minors. Recorded a 2.25 lengths win (23.24) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. With a clean break looks hard to beat. TOBY BELL (1) showed good speed off a low draw but weakened and run over late when 6th over 400m at this track in Grade 5 company. Deserves plenty of respect. MUM'S ON FIRE (2) settled down midfield and held her position to the line when finishing 5th (18.06) at Taree Super Track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Worth following up. KEYS A KRACKEN (3) was in the money last start despite a big quote and is likely to feature again.",
